fense-failure","retrieved":1766174400000},{"title":"MCP Standardizes Tools. It Doesn't Secure Them.","contents":"<a class=\"block\" href=\"/blog/mcp-security-gap\"><time class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 text-sm\" datetime=\"2025-12-19T08:00:00.000Z\">Dec 19, 2025</time><h2 class=\"transition-colors font-semibold group-hover:text-primary mt-1 text-gray-900 text-lg\">MCP Standardizes Tools. It Doesn't Secure Them.</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-2\">The Model Context Protocol solves agent-to-tool communication. But who authorized the agent to use that tool, with what constraints, for which transaction?</p><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap mt-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\">mcp </span><span class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\">security </span><span class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\">tools </span><span class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\">anthropic </span><span class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\">infrastructure</span></div></a>","link":"https://amlalabs.com/blog/mcp-security-gap","retrieved":1766131200000},{"title":"LangChain State of Agent Engineering: Security Is Now a Top Barrier","contents":"<a class=\"block\" href=\"/blog/langchain-state-of-agents-2025\"><time class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 text-sm\" datetime=\"2025-12-18T20:00:00.000Z\">Dec 18, 2025</time><h2 class=\"transition-colors font-semibold group-hover:text-primary mt-1 text-gray-900 text-lg\">LangChain State of Agent Engineering: Security Is Now a Top Barrier</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-2\">1,340 practitioners surveyed. 57% have agents in production. Security ranks as the #1 concern for large enterprises. What this means for agent infrastructure.</p><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap mt-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-gray-400 bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 roun